    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d165">

                <pb facs="0169" n="95" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg95"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 14, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 7th instant, enclosing a copy of a despatch from his
                    excellency the governor general of Canada, in regard to the steps taken by the
                    authorities under his control to guard against the steamer Georgiana getting
                    into the hands of parties hostile to the United States.</p>
                <p>I will thank you to express to his excellency the satisfaction with which this
                    government views his prompt and friendly action in the matter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
